RTX Remix for Minecraft — license overview

This is a multi-component source repository. No single license overrides the
copyright or license notices in its components.

rtx-remix-minecraft/    Apache-2.0; Iris-derived GUI files are LGPL-3.0-only.
rtxremix-java/          Apache-2.0; the copied NVIDIA C API header is MIT.
dxvk-remix/            DXVK: zlib/libpng; NVIDIA Remix code: MIT;
                       identified Caustica-Horizon adaptations: LGPL-3.0-or-later.
remix-horizons/         LGPL-3.0-only, with identified Apache-2.0 components.

NVIDIA SDK binaries and other third-party dependencies retain their own terms.
They are not relicensed by inclusion in a release.

See LICENSES/README.md for component scope and full license texts.
See THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md for source attribution, assets and binary notices.
Existing source-file notices remain authoritative for those files.